# 🚀 Daily DSA Tracker

My daily repository for tracking Data Structures & Algorithms solutions across LeetCode, HackerRank, and CodeChef.

## 📊 Progress Summary
- Run `python tracker.py` to test and log new solutions.
- Run `python -m unittest test_solutions.py` to execute all problem test suites.

## 📁 Data Storage
Logged problems are saved in `dsa_tracker.json`.
